    "prompt": "Implement export class Order(id,items). Each item has quantity and priceCents, both safe integers; quantity is positive and price is nonnegative. Copy input items so later caller mutation cannot change the order. Expose status initially DRAFT, events initially [], and a totalCents getter summing quantity times priceCents. confirm() rejects empty or already confirmed orders, otherwise changes status to CONFIRMED and records one {type:\"OrderConfirmed\",orderId:id} event. Return one JavaScript module for Node 24.",
    "inputs": [
      "fixtures/clean-ddd-hexagonal/ddd-order-confirm/input.json"
    ],
    "grader": "javascript-runtime",
    "references": [
      "reference_outputs/clean-ddd-hexagonal/ddd-order-confirm/good-1.txt"
    ],
    "counterexamples": [
